[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、いたいた！\r\nお－い、樹里！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "な、なんだよ、デカイ声出して",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "デカイ声も出すさ！\r\n 『W.I.N.G.』の最終審査の結果が出たんだぞ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ふぅん、なるほどね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、結果が聞きたくないのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "聞かなくたって\r\nその態度見たら大体想像ついちまうだろ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、それもそうか……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……で、結果はどうだったんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシはアンタの口から聞きたいんだよ\r\n……それで？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。結果はな……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう、樹里！\r\n見事 『W.I.N.G.』の最終審査を突破した！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これで晴れて 『W.I.N.G.』に出場できるぞ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そっか……無事に通過、できたんだな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……まだあんまり実感ね－けど\r\nとりあえず、喜んでいいんだよな？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への出場は新人アイドル最高の名誉だ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里は、すごいことをやったんだよ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そうか……それじゃ、これまで支えてくれたファンに\r\nようやく恩返しができるんだな",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "よし……みんなに良いところ見せられるように\r\nこれからももっともっと頑張らね－とな！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nけど今は……本当におめでとう、樹里",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ……アタシを一番傍で支えてくれた\r\nアンタのお陰だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "プロデュ－サ－……なに湿っぽくなってんだよ\r\n気を抜くには早過ぎんじゃね－のか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100107/7011001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001070120,
